{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/906c9b8809f2379fa829c7effcf71e6b.poster.avif?t=1773129616\" width=608 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/906c9b8809f2379fa829c7effcf71e6b.webm?t=1773129616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Disc creatures WORLD&quot; is a monster taming RPG featuring over 300 unique creatures! Build your party from the creatures you befriend to battle against those who stand in your way! Discover stories featuring creatures and humans alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/ca5b6cd9e485b71ac0ebe11aada55345.poster.avif?t=1773129616\" width=608 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/ca5b6cd9e485b71ac0ebe11aada55345.webm?t=1773129616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where humans and creatures coexist, for better and for worse. Sometimes they work together in harmony, but other times they clash from their differences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid this coexistence, humans developed a groundbreaking technology called &quot;Discs&quot;. These discs record a creature\u2019s data, allowing new creatures with identical abilities to be created. Those who master the use of Discs, known as Disc Rangers\u2014&quot;DiscRs&quot; for short\u2014work alongside creatures to solve a wide variety of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it\u2019s your turn to enter the world of a DiscR. Exciting adventures, challenging encounters, and strange creatures await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/27ff4506f423d5dc7716e36dd39c7a1b.poster.avif?t=1773129616\" width=608 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/27ff4506f423d5dc7716e36dd39c7a1b.webm?t=1773129616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 unique creatures to befriend!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure with your party by your side! Enjoy the companion system that lets your favorite creatures follow you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in strategic 3-on-3 battles! Use shared Energy Points to unleash moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/aecad23576d462493dba70f2363024db.poster.avif?t=1773129616\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/aecad23576d462493dba70f2363024db.webm?t=1773129616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/aecad23576d462493dba70f2363024db.mp4?t=1773129616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your creatures with moves and skills! You can even use creatures that specialize in powerful finishing moves or reflection-based strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Shake&quot; system, which transforms creatures with deepened bonds into new forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/13979231637bef01df26425e782db5e6.avif?t=1773129616\" width=608 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a diverse world! Discover hidden maps, secret dungeons, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied creature-driven events from financial mishaps to ghostly encounters!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of in-game achievements! Collect DisCollCards by befriending creatures!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/4d64c8abafecb71849790cb01f4e346b.poster.avif?t=1773129616\" width=608 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/4d64c8abafecb71849790cb01f4e346b.webm?t=1773129616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Disc creatures WORLD&quot; is a remake of the original &quot;Disc creatures&quot; released in 2016. This new version has been completely reimagined, incorporating systems and features we\u2019ve always dreamed of implementing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While inspired by RPGs of the early 2000s, the game introduces modern gameplay elements, creating a unique experience. It\u2019s highly recommended for fans of monster taming RPGs and anyone who loves creatures and monsters.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440740?t=1773129616","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773129616","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/aff255b7f85737428534eed1c76015fe56a2ce51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773129616","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/aff255b7f85737428534eed1c76015fe56a2ce51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773129616","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4467570,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/906c9b8809f2379fa829c7effcf71e6b.poster.avif?t=1773129616\" width=608 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/906c9b8809f2379fa829c7effcf71e6b.webm?t=1773129616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Disc creatures WORLD&quot; is a monster taming RPG featuring over 300 unique creatures! Build your party from the creatures you befriend to battle against those who stand in your way! Discover stories featuring creatures and humans alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/ca5b6cd9e485b71ac0ebe11aada55345.poster.avif?t=1773129616\" width=608 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/ca5b6cd9e485b71ac0ebe11aada55345.webm?t=1773129616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where humans and creatures coexist, for better and for worse. Sometimes they work together in harmony, but other times they clash from their differences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid this coexistence, humans developed a groundbreaking technology called &quot;Discs&quot;. These discs record a creature\u2019s data, allowing new creatures with identical abilities to be created. Those who master the use of Discs, known as Disc Rangers\u2014&quot;DiscRs&quot; for short\u2014work alongside creatures to solve a wide variety of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it\u2019s your turn to enter the world of a DiscR. Exciting adventures, challenging encounters, and strange creatures await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/27ff4506f423d5dc7716e36dd39c7a1b.poster.avif?t=1773129616\" width=608 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/27ff4506f423d5dc7716e36dd39c7a1b.webm?t=1773129616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 unique creatures to befriend!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure with your party by your side! Enjoy the companion system that lets your favorite creatures follow you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in strategic 3-on-3 battles! Use shared Energy Points to unleash moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/aecad23576d462493dba70f2363024db.poster.avif?t=1773129616\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/aecad23576d462493dba70f2363024db.webm?t=1773129616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/aecad23576d462493dba70f2363024db.mp4?t=1773129616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your creatures with moves and skills! You can even use creatures that specialize in powerful finishing moves or reflection-based strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Shake&quot; system, which transforms creatures with deepened bonds into new forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/13979231637bef01df26425e782db5e6.avif?t=1773129616\" width=608 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a diverse world! Discover hidden maps, secret dungeons, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied creature-driven events from financial mishaps to ghostly encounters!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of in-game achievements! Collect DisCollCards by befriending creatures!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/4d64c8abafecb71849790cb01f4e346b.poster.avif?t=1773129616\" width=608 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/extras/4d64c8abafecb71849790cb01f4e346b.webm?t=1773129616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Disc creatures WORLD&quot; is a remake of the original &quot;Disc creatures&quot; released in 2016. This new version has been completely reimagined, incorporating systems and features we\u2019ve always dreamed of implementing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While inspired by RPGs of the early 2000s, the game introduces modern gameplay elements, creating a unique experience. It\u2019s highly recommended for fans of monster taming RPGs and anyone who loves creatures and monsters.</p>","developers":["Picorinne Soft"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440740/55b859ffbfab1150df6e972c2190e74b3032de16/header.jpg?t=1773129616","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 PICORINNE SOFT<br />\r\nPublished by Phoenixx Inc.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3440740/815978/3095f98b64d15e3d18adf4d61c6573ece94f3749/1750851252/dash_av1.mpd?t=1737449500","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3440740/815978/3095f98b64d15e3d18adf4d61c6573ece94f3749/1750851252/dash_h264.mpd?t=1737449500","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3440740/815978/3095f98b64d15e3d18adf4d61c6573ece94f3749/1750851252/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1737449500","id":257090825,"name":"Disc Creatures World PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257090825/9ec2812bd28f23e34ffa775353d989e9c9594774/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737449500"}],"name":"Disc Creatures WORLD","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 11 / 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Atom Z3735F / Celeron N3000 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Grap